      "created_at": "2013-12-04T21:28:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Its two separate instances of damage he is dealing. So it would be each of his targets take 2+1 then another 2+1.</p><p>Targets can certainly hit you with multiple instances of damage. Watson brought up Fanatic's base power as a prime example. Them being a part of the same sentence is pretty much inconsequential.</p>",
